        <div class="ent-description_wrap max-w-626">
          <hr class="ent-description_divider" />
          <p class="text-md text-primary-lighter">
            Enterprise operations are becoming more distributed, more connected,
            and more dependent on real-time visibility. But many organizations
            still manage connectivity, sensors, assets, and site operations
            through fragmented systems, manual checks, disconnected portals, and
            limited network coverage.
          </p>
          <p class="text-md text-primary-lighter">
            IDSECURE helps bring those environments into one connected operating
            model — connecting IoT devices, extending connectivity to remote and
            mobile environments, monitoring real-world conditions, and managing
            usage, policies, alerts, reports, and connected assets through
            centralized platforms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
